  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Welcome to Little Legs, where we bring comfort, durability, and style to your child's wardrobe. Little Legs was born out of a simple yet pressing need: to find tights that fit children well and lasted more than two washes. Faced with the challenge of keeping little ones warm during chilly Melbourne winters, we set out to create tights and leggings that are not only durable but also incredibly comfortable.</p>\r\n<p>At Little Legs, we aim to provide great basics as well as vibrant, colorful designs to cover the Little Legs in your life. Whether you have boys or girls, from ages 0-6, our collection offers something for everyone. Our commitment to quality ensures that each piece is made to withstand the adventures of childhood while keeping your little ones cozy and stylish.</p>\r\n<p>Thank you for choosing Little Legs. We are delighted to be part of your child's journey, offering clothing that combines practicality with a touch of fun. Explore our range today and discover the perfect fit for your little adventurer.</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Product description: Kid's Bamboo Tights/Tights and Jumpers<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): High quality and funky colours<br>&bull; Payment terms: All<br>&bull; Other information: Located in Melbourne</p>\r\n</div>",
